### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### The spending ceiling (FR-FIN-05)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### 15.9 Rejecting an overspend with no reason -> 400
### The vendor will ask why. A bare rejection answers nothing.
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/project-expenses/{{missingId}}/clearance
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{ "approve": false }

?? status == 400

### 15.10 Clearing an expense that does not exist -> 404
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/project-expenses/{{missingId}}/clearance
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{ "approve": true, "notes": "Emergency pump replacement authorised on site." }

?? status == 404

