### 15.15 A bare failure verdict -> 400
### This is the line an inspector defends if the building later fails, and a one-word failure
### defends nothing.
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/punch-list-items/{{missingId}}/inspect
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{ "verdict": 3, "notes": "bad" }

?? status == 400

### 15.16 Inspecting a line that does not exist -> 404
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/punch-list-items/{{missingId}}/inspect
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{ "verdict": 2, "notes": "Verified on site; annunciates correctly at the panel." }

?? status == 404

