### 15.19 An empty signature pad -> 400
### A canvas signature is an encoded image; a few characters is an untouched pad or a stray dot.
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-instances/{{missingId}}/closure/sign/client
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{ "signatureBase64": "x", "representativeName": "Eng. Faisal Al-Harbi" }

?? status == 400

### 15.20 A client signature with nobody named -> 400
### The company must be able to say who signed, by name and title.
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/workflow-instances/{{missingId}}/closure/sign/client
Authorization: Bearer {{companyAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{ "signatureBase64": "{{signature}}", "representativeName": "" }

?? status == 400

